    {
      "ordinal": 10,
      "depth": 1,
      "kind": "rule",
      "number": "3.5",
      "title": "Others",
      "body": "● Great helms may be decorated in the spirit of medieval styles, such as an orle, torse, decorated aventails (with copper/brass chainmail rings) coat of arms badges, etc.\n● Such decoration must be made in coherence with historical sources.\n● Using modern and/or offensive imagery and slogans is prohibited.",
